{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12108160","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12108160","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1210816001:1":{"text":"うーん……さっきのメモの続きみたいですね。このロゼスという人は島に長いこと滞在しているようです……","source_cn":"嗯……这是前面那份笔记的后续，看起来罗赛斯在岛上待了很久……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20F463F41A4A769F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1210816002:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">神が財宝を賜りし場所</style>で、風にあたりながら日なたぼっこをすると書いていますね。","source_cn":"他说他经常去<style=highlight>神明赐予...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE74A4E77DDBB0FD1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210816003:1":{"text":"風は前方から吹いているので……このまま真っすぐ進めば、その場所に辿り着けるかもしれません。","source_cn":"风是从前面吹过来的……这么说，我们继续朝着前方走，就是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0FEE4F8BA5B26F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1210816004:0":{"text":"でも、その財宝を賜りし場所とやらに、たくさんグルグルが書かれてるよ？これってどういう意味かな？","source_cn":"对，但神明赐予宝藏的地方还划了好多波浪圈，满满不太明白...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F48DD4AA9BEC4C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210816005:0":{"text":"見せてみろ……これは<style=\"highlight\">大渦（おおうず）</style>だな。民謡では渦の下に宝が隠されているとある、きっとその渦が道になってるんだ！","source_cn":"让我看看……这一定是<style=highlight>...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x679007C5B43198B